、彼女は民衆にとって新たな希望の灯となった。村人をモンスターから守り、国の腐敗した支配者を打倒するための革命を率いる。彼女は新たな一日への希望に満ちた、太陽そのものを象徴している。\n- モチーフ：太陽、盾、ペガサス、鹿、慈愛に満ちた手、暖炉、家\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1njxK3e9Yl3QEM9OqttavxllW4Yyrva6F?usp=drive_link\n\nご依頼をご検討いただき、ありがとうございます！", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@suisha/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea073577/uploads/origins/365c45c3-f195-483c-b39a-aa5526a909ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6e3caa8d33f45da1c8b337518840d72d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea073577/uploads/origins/365c45c3-f195-483c-b39a-aa5526a909ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6e3caa8d33f45da1c8b337518840d72d, https://si.imgix.net/ea073577/uploads/origins/365c45c3-f195-483c-b39a-aa5526a909ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=87bcd434473e533d960a324ddc301bcf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea073577/uploads/origins/365c45c3-f195-483c-b39a-aa5526a909ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4e118d4f6bbdcfc1528cd7f20098e838 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3949733, "client_id": 1500785, "nc": 0}, {"path": "/@suisha/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3949733, "client_id": 377196, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/be4bfd14/uploads/origins/d0949691-03b5-44c4-a885-a71fc7875d06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=